00:30:08.516 --> 00:30:10.059
Nu, mulțumesc.

00:30:13.020 --> 00:30:14.271
Ești sigură?

00:30:16.148 --> 00:30:17.274
Sunt foarte buni.

00:30:20.110 --> 00:30:22.863
